  "description": "Read, validate, parse, and generate IATA SSIM (Iata manual chapter 7) and Airport Coordination Slot (Iata manual chapter 6) messages with ease. \n\t\tA streamlined library for reliable, standards-compliant airline schedule and slot data processing.",
